{"id":45766,"date":"2025-10-13T09:12:39","date_gmt":"2025-10-13T08:12:39","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=45766"},"modified":"2026-08-23T22:52:51","modified_gmt":"2026-08-23T21:52:51","slug":"corrida-das-lezirias","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/corrida-das-lezirias\/","title":{"rendered":"Corrida das Lez\u00edrias 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>A m\u00edtica e adorada Corrida das Lez\u00edrias celebra a 31\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o em 2026!<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Vila Franca de Xira volta a ser, no dia&nbsp;<strong>01&nbsp;de mar\u00e7o 2026<\/strong>, o palco da tradicional&nbsp;Corrida das Lez\u00edrias&nbsp;que, anualmente, re\u00fane na cidade milhares de atletas e amantes do desporto, oriundos de todo o pa\u00eds.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Poder\u00e1s participar na prova principal de 15,5 km que conta com um percurso em asfalto, cal\u00e7ada e terra batida, na prova de 5 km&nbsp;em piso betuminoso ou na&nbsp;corridinha&nbsp;de 400 metros a&nbsp;800 metros, dedicada aos atletas mais novos.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":45767,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[28,27,478,624],"event_type_2":[33,727,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-45766","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-vila-franca-de-xira-lisboa","event_type-corrida-10-km","event_type-corrida","event_type-corridas-inferior-10","event_type-kids","event_type_2-lisboa","event_type_2-lisboa-e-centro","event_type_2-portugal"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/thumbnail_Xistarca_02_V02-750x